{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>The offspring of your cattle.</b> The young of your herd — which the animal casts from its womb." "<b>And the flocks of your sheep.</b> As the Targum renders. And our Sages said: Why is their name called עַשְׁתָּרוֹת? Because they enrich their owners and sustain them — like those עַשְׁתָּרוֹת which are strong sheqels."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:48:33.453261652Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}